## Software and machine-readable materials

The following materials are licensed under the PolyForm Noncommercial
License 1.0.0 in `LICENSES/PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0.md`:

- source code, tests, build and validation tools;
- repository automation and configuration;
- machine-readable schemas, manifests, datasets, fixtures, indexes, and
  Prompt DSL packages;
- agent and skill implementation files, including `AGENTS.md`, `.codex/`,
  and `ai/`.

For mixed files, this license applies to functional code, configuration, and
machine-readable portions unless the file carries a more specific notice.

## Documentation and visual materials

Original human-readable documentation and original visual materials are
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
International license in `LICENSES/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt`.

This scope includes Markdown publications, specifications, explanatory prose,
PNG/JPEG/SVG artwork, and CSDL-owned PDF publications, except for the agent and
skill implementation files assigned to the software scope above.

Attribution should identify:

> Constructive Signal Design Language (CSDL) by Vladyslav Ohirenko

Include a link to the source repository, identify modifications, and retain the
applicable license notice when sharing licensed material.

## Commercial use

Neither public license grants commercial use. Commercial use requires a
separate written license from Vladyslav Ohirenko. Request commercial terms
through <https://github.com/vladagurets>.

